<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>ILdevBot - Paramètres</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        .tabs {
            display: flex;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2a2a2a;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            background: #191a1f;
            border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .tab-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #b5c9df;
            font-size: 1.18em;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 16px 36px 12px 36px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
            transition: color 0.18s, border-bottom 0.18s, background 0.18s;
            outline: none;
            position: relative;
        }
        .tab-btn.active {
            color: #4e96ff;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #4e96ff;
            background: #18191e;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(49,85,255,0.08);
        }
        .tab-content { display: none; animation: fadein 0.4s; }
        .tab-content.active { display: block; }
        @keyframes fadein { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
        .config-section { background: #191a1f; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 32px 18px 32px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.09); }
        .config-section h2 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.3em; color: #4e96ff; }
        .desc { color: #aaa; font-size: 1em; margin-bottom: 18px; margin-top: -8px; }
        .form-row { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .form-row label { flex: 1; font-weight: 500; }
        .form-row input, .form-row select, .form-row textarea { flex: 2; padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; background: #23242a; color: #eaeaea; font-size: 1em; }
        .form-row textarea { min-height: 38px; }
        .form-row .tooltip {
            margin-left: 7px;
            color: #4e96ff;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #4e96ff;
            position: relative;
        }
        .form-row .tooltip:hover::after {
            content: attr(data-tip);
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 22px;
            background: #23242a;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.98em;
            white-space: pre-line;
            z-index: 10;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(49,85,255,0.13);
        }
        .custom-btn.save {
            width: 260px;
            font-size: 1.25em;
            margin: 24px auto 0 auto;
            display: block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3499fa 0%, #5ae6b4 100%);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 10px 0 rgba(49,85,255,0.08);
            padding: 16px 0;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: box-shadow .2s, background .2s;
        }
        .custom-btn.save:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #247bc3 0%, #3cb98c 100%);
        }
        .required:after { content: '*'; color: #ff6464; margin-left: 3px; }
        .theme-toggle {
            position: fixed;
            top: 16px;
            right: 16px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #b5c9df;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .theme-toggle:hover {
            color: #4e96ff;
        }
        /* Sidebar styles */
        .sidebar {
            width: 250px;
            background: #191a1f;
            padding: 20px;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            transition: width 0.2s;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .sidebar.collapsed {
            width: 80px;
        }
        .sidebar-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .sidebar-logo img {
            transition: width 0.2s;
        }
        .sidebar-title {
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #b5c9df;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .sidebar-menu {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .sidebar-menu li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .sidebar-menu a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: #b5c9df;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
        }
        .sidebar-menu a:hover {
            background: #4e96ff;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .sidebar-menu a.active {
            background: #4e96ff;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .sidebar-menu a[data-icon] {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 40px;
        }
        .sidebar-menu a[data-icon]:before {
            content: attr(data-icon);
            position: absolute;
            left: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }
        /* Main content styles */
        .main-content {
            margin-left: 250px;
            padding: 20px;
            transition: margin-left 0.2s;
        }
        .main-content.collapsed {
            margin-left: 80px;
        }
        /* Sticky footer styles */
        .sticky-footer {
            position: sticky;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: #191a1f;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
            color: #aaa;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .sidebar {
                width: 70px !important;
                min-width: 70px !important;
                padding: 12px 0 0 0 !important;
            }
            .sidebar-logo img {
                width: 48px !important;
            }
            .sidebar-title {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .sidebar-menu a span {
                display: none !important;
            }
            .sidebar-menu a {
                padding: 11px 0 11px 18px !important;
                text-align: left;
                font-size: 1.3em !important;
            }
            .sidebar-menu a:before {
                content: attr(data-icon);
                font-size: 1.3em;
                margin-right: 0;
            }
            .main-content {
                margin-left: 70px !important;
                padding: 10px 2vw !important;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .sidebar {
                width: 100vw !important;
                min-width: unset !important;
                flex-direction: row !important;
                justify-content: flex-start !important;
                align-items: flex-start !important;
                padding: 10px 0 0 0 !important;
                box-shadow: none !important;
            }
            .sidebar.collapsed {
                width: 60px !important;
                min-width: 60px !important;
            }
            .main-content {
                margin-left: 0 !important;
                padding: 10px 2vw !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
            const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content');
            tabs.forEach((tab, idx) => {
                tab.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
                    contents.forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));
                    tab.classList.add('active');
                    contents[idx].classList.add('active');
                });
            });
            if (tabs.length) { tabs[0].click(); }

            // Theme toggle logic
            const btn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
            const prefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;
            let theme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || (prefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light');
            document.body.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);
            btn.innerText = theme === 'dark' ? '🌙' : '☀️';
            btn.onclick = function() {
                theme = (theme === 'dark') ? 'light' : 'dark';
                document.body.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);
                localStorage.setItem('theme', theme);
                btn.innerText = theme === 'dark' ? '🌙' : '☀️';
            };

            // Affichage/masquage mot de passe MT5 (icône dans la barre, style login moderne)
            const pwdInput = document.getElementById('mt5_password');
            const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('toggle-mt5-password');
            if (pwdInput && toggleBtn) {
                toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
                    if (pwdInput.type === 'password') {
                        pwdInput.type = 'text';
                        toggleBtn.textContent = '🙈';
                    } else {
                        pwdInput.type = 'password';
                        toggleBtn.textContent = '👁️';
                    }
                });
            }

            // Sidebar collapse/expand
            const sidebar = document.querySelector('.sidebar');
            const toggleBtnSidebar = document.getElementById('sidebar-toggle');
            const toggleIcon = document.getElementById('sidebar-toggle-icon');
            let collapsed = localStorage.getItem('sidebarCollapsed') === 'true';
            function setSidebarState(state) {
                collapsed = state;
                if (collapsed) {
                    sidebar.classList.add('collapsed');
                    toggleIcon.textContent = '⏵';
                } else {
                    sidebar.classList.remove('collapsed');
                    toggleIcon.textContent = '⏴';
                }
                localStorage.setItem('sidebarCollapsed', collapsed);
            }
            setSidebarState(collapsed);
            toggleBtnSidebar.onclick = function() {
                setSidebarState(!collapsed);
            };
        });
    </script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container-main">
    <!-- SIDEBAR -->
    <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-logo" style="margin-bottom:38px;">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" width="140" style="transition:width 0.2s;" alt="logo">
            <button id="sidebar-toggle" aria-label="Réduire/agrandir la barre" style="background:none;border:none;position:absolute;right:10px;top:18px;font-size:1.6em;cursor:pointer;z-index:10;transition:transform 0.2s;">
                <span id="sidebar-toggle-icon">⏴</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        <h3 class="sidebar-title" style="margin-top:30px;">MENU</h3>
        <nav>
            <ul class="sidebar-menu">
                <li><a href="/dashboard" data-icon="📊"><span>Dashboard</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="/trades" data-icon="📈"><span>Trades ouverts</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="/journal" data-icon="📊"><span>Journal de trading</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="/logs" data-icon="📝"><span>Logs</span></a></li>
                <li><a href="/parametre" data-icon="⚙️"><span>Paramètres</span></a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </aside>
    <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
    <main class="main-content">
        <h1 class="main-title">⚙️ Configurations du bot</h1>
        <% if (message) { %>
            <div class="alert-success"><%= message %></div>
        <% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/parametre">
            <div class="tabs">
                <button class="tab-btn" type="button">🔑 MT5</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" type="button">💬 Telegram</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" type="button">📈 Trading</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" type="button">🛡️ Risques/Symboles</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" type="button">🧩 Parser avancé</button>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-content">
                <div class="config-section">
                    <h2>🔑 MT5</h2>
                    <div class="desc">Configure ici tes identifiants de connexion à MetaTrader 5.</div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label class="required">Login MT5</label><input type="text" name="mt5_login" value="<%= config.mt5_login %>" required /></div>
                    <div class="form-row" style="position:relative;">
                        <label class="required">Mot de passe MT5</label>
                        <input type="password" name="mt5_password" id="mt5_password" value="<%= config.mt5_password %>" required style="width:100%;padding-right:2.2em;" />
                        <button type="button" id="toggle-mt5-password" style="position:absolute;right:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.1em;padding:0;line-height:1;opacity:0.7;" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Afficher/masquer le mot de passe" title="Afficher/masquer le mot de passe">👁️</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label class="required">Serveur MT5</label><input type="text" name="mt5_server" value="<%= config.mt5_server %>" required /></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-content">
                <div class="config-section">
                    <h2>💬 Telegram</h2>
                    <div class="desc">Renseigne ici les infos de ton API Telegram et les canaux à surveiller.</div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label class="required">API ID</label><input type="text" name="telegram_api_id" value="<%= config.telegram_api_id %>" required /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label class="required">API Hash</label><input type="text" name="telegram_api_hash" value="<%= config.telegram_api_hash %>" required /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>IDs des canaux (séparés par des virgules)</label><textarea name="telegram_channel"><%= Array.isArray(config.telegram_channel) ? config.telegram_channel.join(',') : '' %></textarea></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Nom du fichier session</label><input type="text" name="telegram_session" value="<%= config.telegram_session %>" /></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-content">
                <div class="config-section">
                    <h2>📈 Trading</h2>
                    <div class="desc">Paramètres de trading : mode réel ou simulation, break-even, TP, etc.</div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Mode de trading</label>
                        <select name="mode">
                            <option value="mt5_trading" <%= config.mode === 'mt5_trading' ? 'selected' : '' %>>MT5 Trading</option>
                            <option value="paper" <%= config.mode === 'paper' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Paper Trading</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Break-even</label><input type="checkbox" name="break_even_enabled" value="1" <%= config.break_even_enabled ? 'checked' : '' %> /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Mode TP</label>
                        <select name="tp_mode">
                            <option value="progressive" <%= config.tp_mode === 'progressive' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Progressif</option>
                            <option value="all_at_tp1" <%= config.tp_mode === 'all_at_tp1' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Tout au TP1</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Stats à la sortie</label><input type="checkbox" name="show_stats_on_exit" value="1" <%= config.show_stats_on_exit ? 'checked' : '' %> /></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-content">
                <div class="config-section">
                    <h2>🛡️ Risques/Symboles</h2>
                    <div class="desc">Définis ici les limites de risque et la liste des symboles autorisés.</div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Max lot</label><input type="number" step="0.01" name="risk_max_lot" value="<%= config.risk.max_lot %>" /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Perte journalière max</label><input type="number" name="risk_max_daily_loss" value="<%= config.risk.max_daily_loss %>" /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Nb max de trades ouverts</label><input type="number" name="risk_max_open_trades" value="<%= config.risk.max_open_trades %>" /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>SL requis</label><input type="checkbox" name="risk_stop_loss_required" value="1" <%= config.risk.stop_loss_required ? 'checked' : '' %> /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Lot par défaut</label><input type="number" step="0.01" name="risk_default_lot" value="<%= config.risk.default_lot %>" /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Break-even au TP</label><input type="checkbox" name="risk_break_even_on_tp" value="1" <%= config.risk.break_even_on_tp ? 'checked' : '' %> /></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Symboles autorisés (séparés par des virgules)</label><textarea name="risk_allowed_symbols"><%= Array.isArray(config.risk.allowed_symbols) ? config.risk.allowed_symbols.join(',') : '' %></textarea></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-content">
                <div class="config-section">
                    <h2>🧩 Parser avancé</h2>
                    <div class="desc">Personnalise les regex pour parser les signaux Telegram.<span class="tooltip" data-tip="Utilise des regex pour extraire symbol, type, TP, SL des messages.">?</span></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Regex symbol <span class="tooltip" data-tip="Exemple : \\b(XAUUSD|EURUSD)\\b">?</span></label><textarea name="parser_symbol_pattern"><%= config.signal_parser.symbol_pattern %></textarea></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Regex type <span class="tooltip" data-tip="Exemple : \\b(BUY|SELL)\\b">?</span></label><textarea name="parser_type_pattern"><%= config.signal_parser.type_pattern %></textarea></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Regex TP <span class="tooltip" data-tip="Exemple : (?i)\\b((tp|takeprofit)...">?</span></label><textarea name="parser_tp_pattern"><%= config.signal_parser.tp_pattern %></textarea></div>
                    <div class="form-row"><label>Regex SL <span class="tooltip" data-tip="Exemple : \\bSL\\s*[:=, \\s]+(-?\\d+[.,]?\\d*)">?</span></label><textarea name="parser_sl_pattern"><%= config.signal_parser.sl_pattern %></textarea></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button class="custom-btn save" type="submit">💾 Sauvegarder la config</button>
        </form>
        <footer class="sticky-footer">
            <hr style="margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:10px; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #3a3a3a;">
            ILdevBot V1 — une solution simple, pour faire grandir vos ambitions de trading.<br>
            © 2025 Tous droits réservés.
        </footer>
    </main>
    <button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle" title="Basculer mode clair/sombre">🌙</button>
</div>
</body>
</html>
